es into the plugin once they are resident (prepare, commit, clear on the plugin's opendaw.samples/1) and tells the plugin through the host's that the host keeps them. A plugin page hands the studio a file for a key (webclapSample, relayed by wclap-frame.html): the studio imports it, or links the sample it was dragged from in the browser, and points the slot at it; an emptied slot keeps its box. The engine re-binds a device's sample slots with its parameters, so a slot added while the plugin runs is delivered (Apparat rebuilt the device on every change, a WebCLAP device does not). test/wclap-samples.test.ts runs Radar (open-webclap, MIT, AGPL-3.0 as built) through the engine, test/assets/xenon.wasm is Xenon with the extension.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"apache/camel","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:00:28Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"b240602dbb1d91a1cfe5d454679b68a76fb6e06b","github_link":"https://github.com/apache/camel/commit/b240602dbb1d91a1cfe5d454679b68a76fb6e06b","commit_subject":"CAMEL-26441: camel-launcher - The distribution runs the Camel CLI from the Spring Boot fat jar, which is slower and has no class data sharing (#28776)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"apache/camel","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:00:20Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"5af9b31e69110b07f73c9bed1d7f9a99e541a348","github_link":"https://github.com/apache/camel/commit/5af9b31e69110b07f73c9bed1d7f9a99e541a348","commit_subject":"CAMEL-26440: camel-jbang - A command of a plugin creates all the commands of the CLI and of the other plugins (#28774)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pyrocko/qseek","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:00:04Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"5fd4f180e885e72e4250a784e4b33526308dc7fd","github_link":"https://github.com/pyrocko/qseek/commit/5fd4f180e885e72e4250a784e4b33526308dc7fd","commit_subject":"sds: cache the file lookups of a station and day","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"mwemuorg/mwemu","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:59:50Z","branch":"main","co